WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.160
We are now moving into our penultimate module, Environmental Emergencies.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:11.680
As the image of the wasp suggests, bites from animals, insects, or even humans are a major

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:16.840
part of this section, and they can range from simple irritations to life-threatening events.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:21.480
We'll also explore other important topics like ingestion of poisonous substances and

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.520
opioid emergencies and overdoses.

